==================================================
USE THE AERIAL VIDEO
====================

The user has **one aerial video of the property**.

The video MUST actually play inside the website.

Create a large cinematic video section.

Use:

<video controls playsinline preload="metadata">

and leave a clearly marked area for the real video file:

<!-- PROPERTY AERIAL VIDEO HERE -->

Example expected implementation:

<video controls playsinline poster="...">
    <source src="property-aerial.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>

Do NOT embed a fake YouTube video.

Do NOT use an external video unless explicitly configured later.

The video section should include:

* cinematic aspect ratio
* play button
* controls
* responsive sizing
* poster image placeholder
* graceful fallback message

On the homepage, show a muted/autoplay preview if technically appropriate and allowed, but make sure the full video can be manually played with controls.

