PROPERTY INFORMATION
====================

Use this property description carefully:

"Welcome to this beautifully maintained private retreat backing to serene greenspace and ideally located near Butler Creek Greenway Trails and Butler Creek Park.

Built in 1993, this spacious 2,633 SF home sits on a 9,685 SF lot and offers 4 bedrooms, or 3 bedrooms plus a dedicated office/den, and 2.5 baths.

Soaring ceilings, skylights, and expansive windows fill the home with natural light.

The gourmet kitchen features a center island, stainless steel appliances, built-in gas cooktop with downdraft, new built-in oven, dishwasher, refrigerator, granite countertops, pantry, oak cabinetry and flooring, plus a bright dining nook with direct access to the deck and backyard via slider.

The primary suite offers both walk-in and reach-in closets, along with a private bath featuring dual vanities, a walk-in shower, and skylight.

Additional living spaces include a formal dining room, vaulted living room with large picture windows, and a comfortable family room with a brick gas fireplace.

Upstairs, the bonus room features vaulted ceilings, a ceiling fan, built-in desk, and attic storage.

The main-level laundry room includes a utility sink, built-in cabinetry, workspace, and ironing station.

Additional highlights include central air conditioning, gas forced-air heating, gas water heater, central vacuum system, security system, abundant storage, attached two-car garage, and no HOA dues.

A one-year home warranty is included.

The beautifully landscaped grounds showcase mature plantings, brick walkways, and a private patio, creating an ideal setting for outdoor living and entertaining.

Conveniently located near Schools, Parks, Trails, Shopping, Dining, Historic Downtown Gresham, Oxbow Regional Park, Springwater Corridor Trail, and Hogan Butte Nature Park."

Do not add facts that aren't provided.

